Program1- Evalaute Expression Strings


Problem Statement

Given an expression in string format print the value of the expression after 
evaluating 

Rules for Evaluation :
The expression is Evaluated from Left to Right and operators allowed are
only +,-,/,*
Ignore Operator Precedence and evaluate the expression from left to right
Assume the expression only consists of numbers(0-9)(both positive and 
negative) and 
operators(+,-,*,/)

Test Case-1
input = 2+3*6
output = 30

Explanation :- The sum of 2+3 is 5 and 5*6 = 30 


Test Case-2
